```

These milestone labels express roadmap dependency order only. Each still requires its own source-fit, reviewed/frozen implementation plan, and explicit implementation authorization.

# 0. Executive decision

The reusable-production critical path remains authoritative. M11–M14 are now published; the current roadmap frontier is M15→M16, after which the corrected Performance program begins only if G8 closes.

The roadmap is:

```text
M11  Publish Reusable Production Revisions
        ↓
M12  Compose Stable Production Occurrences
        ↓
M13  Authority-Complete Reusable World
        ↓
      REMEMBER THE WORLD
        ↓
M14  World Observation + Execution Enforcement
        ↓
      SHOOT THE WORLD
        ↓
M15  Safe Reusable-Revision Evolution
        ↓
M16  Intra-Shot Persistent Consequences
```

After M16 and the integrated sequence rerun, G8 must close before the Performance program can freeze. The M17A→M17C sequence below is the preferred next continuity program; it remains separately unauthorised implementation work.

The **current planned frontier** is therefore:

```text
M15  Safe Reusable-Revision Evolution
        ↓
M16  Intra-Shot Persistent Consequences
        ↓
post-M16 integrated sequence rerun
        ↓
G8 Performance / Dialogue Co-Design
        ↓
