```

M11–M14 already established the reusable physical production identity, Composition/occurrence model, authority-complete world capture, and real production-world execution path. M15/M16 are not authorized merely because they are next in this roadmap.

The roadmap still deliberately avoids speculative universal rigging, full Sound Post, candidate-world reconstruction, or generalized representation expansion before a concrete consumer requires them.

