# 18. Explicit future domains outside this roadmap program

The following remain outside M11–M16 and are not automatically scheduled by completion of this roadmap:

```text
universal character rig/deformation/editor system
continuous story-clock domain
full simulation production authority
editorial authority — exact schema still future; G12 deterministic-resolution/materialization perimeter now defined
compositing authority
color-management/creative-grade authority
Sound Post authority beyond A7 dialogue/vocal performance
mastering/delivery authority
multi-user collaboration semantics
agent-authored production flows
```

Dialogue/vocal performance is **not** in that deferred Sound Post line. The boundary is:

```text
A7 Dialogue/Vocal Performance      future Sound Post
acting speech used by animation   Foley / ambience / SFX / music
retained vocal take + timebase     dialogue processing/editing
facial sync source                 mix / mastering / delivery
```

If a later dialogue edit/ADR changes words, timing, phrasing, or acting and is intended to drive animation, it re-enters A7 as a new Vocal Performance candidate/revision.

They remain legitimate future product domains. Their existence does not weaken the M11–M16 claims, provided those claims remain scoped exactly as stated.

