# 21. Summary invariant

The roadmap is intentionally simple at its core:

```text
FIRST
make an approved production thing reusable

THEN
compose reusable things into stable occurrences

THEN
make SoloRing remember that exact world across story state, space, Shots, and history

THEN
make execution observe that world without weakening hard production requirements

THEN
let the world evolve safely

THEN
let persistent facts change inside a Shot without making generated pixels the authority

LATER, UNDER A SEPARATE G12 DESIGN GATE
let approved Takes enter editorial/conform by exact retained source identity, with replaceable proxies, explicit media-preservation classes, and executor-independent edit authority
```

That sequence converts SoloRing from a strong vertical Shot-continuity system into the persistent reusable production system required for feature-film-scale filmmaking while preserving the historical, authority, provenance, and execution-isolation invariants already earned by the M10F baseline.
